Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some homes keep pace with Tel Aviv.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This one also knows how to close the door on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:11.27,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  MORNING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:15.45,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.77,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aerial video of the area
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Morning in Kochav HaTzafon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You step out of a brand-new boutique building into one of the quietest, greenest neighbourhoods in north Tel Aviv.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:21.94,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE NEIGHBOURHOOD CENTRE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:21.69,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.94,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:28.12,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,A minute's walk away is the neighbourhood centre:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:24.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,the deli, fresh bread, the nut shop, the supermarket,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,and coffee with friends who live around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:32.27,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE BRIDGE TO YARKON PARK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.69,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aerial video of the area
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:36.14,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aerial photo · the neighbourhood and the park today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:45.52,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Planned bridge · simulation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is what changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new bridge for walking and cycling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:37.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,a hundred and seventy metres long, is being built over Rokach Boulevard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it opens in 2027, you walk straight from the neighbourhood into Yarkon Park,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:44.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,without crossing a single road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:49.70,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  YARKON PARK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:47.92,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aerial video of the area
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:51.90,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:54.22,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Illustration
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:57.54,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aerial video of the area
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Almost four thousand dunams of park:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.67,0:00:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,running paths along the river, cycling, and long Saturdays on the lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:57.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And right by the home, tennis courts and football pitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:01.70,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  A BRAND-NEW HOME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:04.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back home, a brand-new mini penthouse of about 197 sqm, on the eleventh floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bespoke joinery, a designer kitchen, a master suite with an open view of the Tel Aviv skyline,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:13.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a children's suite that looks out to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:18.07,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE TERRACES
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then, the real living room:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:19.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,about 80 sqm of terraces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Made for long evenings, a grill, and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:27.74,Chap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,500)}{\c&H00BFB34F}━━{\c&H00FFFFFF}  THE NUMBERS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:42.51,Tag,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Aerial photo · the Sde Dov quarter under construction
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:25.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The numbers matter too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:28.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Between 2023 and October 2025,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:34.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,the median home deal in Kochav HaTzafon was NIS 6.1 million, the fourth highest in Israel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:39.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,To the north, the Sde Dov quarter is adding 16,000 new homes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Green Line light rail is planned for 2028.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:47.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Technion study found that homes closest to Yarkon Park are worth more, and abroad,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.93,0:01:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,new park links have lifted nearby home values by five to twenty percent, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,A home with Tel Aviv on one side and the park on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a private viewing, call Meital Katzir.
